# Contentful — copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
#
# Nuxt reads `.env` once, at startup. After editing it, restart `npm run dev` —
# a reload in the browser is not enough.
#
# Where the values come from: Contentful → Settings → API keys → your key.
#
# The names matter: Nuxt maps a `NUXT_*` variable onto `runtimeConfig` by stripping
# the prefix and lowercasing the rest, so `NUXT_CONTENTFUL_SPACE_ID` fills
# `runtimeConfig.contentful.spaceId`. Every key is also declared in `nuxt.config.ts`
# — an undeclared key is ignored silently, and in this app "ignored" looks exactly
# like "Contentful has no content".
#
# ⚠️ **These are unprefixed (`NUXT_`), not `NUXT_PUBLIC_`, and that is the point.**
# `runtimeConfig.contentful` is the *private* half, read only by
# `server/api/contentful/[operation]`. The browser never sees these values and never
# talks to Contentful directly — it calls our own route, which adds the token
# server-side. So there is nothing here that could be inlined into the client bundle,
# and adding a Preview token later needs no restructuring.

# Required. Space ID.
NUXT_CONTENTFUL_SPACE_ID=

# Required. The **Content Delivery API** access token.
#
# It no longer has to be a Delivery token for safety's sake — a Preview or Management
# token would also stay on the server now — but only the Delivery API is queried, so a
# Delivery token is what belongs here.
NUXT_CONTENTFUL_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Optional. Contentful environment. Defaults to `master`.
NUXT_CONTENTFUL_ENVIRONMENT=master

# Optional. Only needed for an EU-hosted space, which uses a different host.
# NUXT_CONTENTFUL_GRAPHQL_HOST=graphql.eu.contentful.com

# Not implemented. Reading draft entries needs the Preview API and a Preview token, and
# nothing in this app does either. The groundwork is now done — the token would live
# here, unprefixed, and be read by the existing route — so what remains is a `preview`
# flag on the request, its own queries, and a cache key that keeps drafts from being
# served to everyone else.
#
# NUXT_CONTENTFUL_PREVIEW_TOKEN=
